# Tatum

> Multi-chain blockchain developer platform: managed RPC, APIs, webhooks, wallets, and pricing data across 100+ networks.

Tatum helps teams build wallets, exchanges, payments, DeFi, gaming, and NFT products without running their own nodes. Core offerings include a managed RPC gateway (smart routing, failover, geo balancing), unified REST APIs, on-chain event notifications, smart wallets (WaaS), and real-time crypto price data. For anything time-sensitive (supported chains, rate limits, pricing), treat live docs as the source of truth.

## Products

- [RPC Nodes](https://tatum.io/products/nodes.md): Unlimited RPC access to 120+ chains
- [RPC Router](https://tatum.io/gateway): Intelligent RPC routing — load balancing, method routing, failover, caching, and BYO endpoints
- [Blockchain Data API](https://tatum.io/products/data-api.md): Balances, transactions, tokens, NFTs
- [Notifications](https://tatum.io/products/notifications.md): On-chain webhooks and event subscriptions
- [Smart Wallets](https://tatum.io/products/wallets.md): Wallet-as-a-Service (WaaS)
- [Crypto Price API](https://tatum.io/products/price-api.md): Real-time exchange rates

